@inproceedings{sheta-etal-2025-behavioral,
    title = "From Behavioral Performance to Internal Competence: Interpreting Vision-Language Models with VLM-Lens",
    author = "Sheta, Hala  and
      Huang, Eric Haoran  and
      Wu, Shuyu  and
      Alenabi, Ilia  and
      Hong, Jiajun  and
